column44:
I have no idea what you&#x27;re talking about.  My point is more pragmatic the regex /A<i>/ will match the string &quot;QQQQ&quot; and this tool doesn&#x27;t take that into account.  E.g., I type this into my javascript console:<p><pre><code>     /A*/.test(&#x27;QQQQ&#x27;);
     > true
</code></pre>
Showing that yes, /A</i>/ does match &#x27;QQQQ&#x27;
